---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ClearCareer"
  description="ClearCareer privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)] leading-[1.05] text-navy">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">Last updated: November 21, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.75] text-text">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">When you book a call, subscribe to our newsletter, or enroll in a program, we collect your name, email address, and any information you voluntarily provide. We also collect standard analytics data through cookies and similar technologies.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Before a call, our booking form asks about your job search (for example, how many applications and interviews you've had, your target roles and salary, and whether you're ready to invest). We use these answers to prepare for the call and to decide whether a call is a good use of your time.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If you join a program, we also collect your intake: your LinkedIn profile, the resumes, cover letters and other files you choose to upload, your career wins, and your preference about appearing in call recordings. When you sign the client agreement, we record the name you type, the date and time, your IP address and the version of the agreement.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We use your information to provide our coaching services, send you career resources you've requested, process payments, and improve our programs. We never sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We use Calendly for scheduling, Stripe (and Klarna, if you choose it) for payments, Brevo for email, Google Workspace (Google Drive, Docs and Sheets) to store program files and signed agreements, Mighty Networks for the program community, Vercel to host this website, and standard analytics tools. Each of these services has their own privacy policies governing how they handle your data, and some of them store data outside Canada.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">Program Files and Recordings</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Files you upload for a program are kept in a private ClearCareer Google Drive folder and used only to deliver your program. We don't share them. Group calls may be recorded so members can rewatch them, and recordings are shared only inside the program community. You tell us at intake whether you're comfortable appearing in recordings. We quote clients or share their results publicly only with their written permission.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us at izzy@joinclearcareer.com.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Questions about this policy? Email us at izzy@joinclearcareer.com.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
